:(deftest peers-publication-and-binding-are-separate-explicit-flags\ntest/yin/repl/dht_test.cljc:206:    (testing \"peers declare nothing: publication stays off\"\ntest/yin/repl/dht_test.cljc:293:              \"the publication is durable locally, HEAD moved\")\ntest/yin/repl/dht_test.cljc:337:;; Bullet 2: publication is its own flag, and the REPL states what it shares\ntest/yin/repl/dht_test.cljc:360:;; Bullet 3: per-publication acknowledgement, and no round waits\ntest/yin/repl/dht_test.cljc:375:(deftest a-publication-sent-to-two-peers-is-reported-acknowledged\ntest/yin/repl/dht_test.cljc:427:  a-partial-publication-is-reported-and-repaired-through-the-host-module\ntest/yin/repl/dht_test.cljc:535:(deftest a-publication-with-publishing-off-is-reported-and-sends-nothing\ntest/yin/repl/dht_test.cljc:545:        (is (line-with lines \"publication is off\"))\ntest/yin/repl/dht_test.cljc:554:(deftest a-publication-short-of-peers-is-reported-with-why-at-the-deadline\ntest/yin/repl/dht_test.cljc:922:   publishing peers at 2 and 3, stepped until the holder's publication is\ntest/yin/repl/dht_test.cljc:1089:                   \"the node reported a publication, an index loa\"\ntest/yin/repl/dht_test.cljc:2050:        (testing \"the round's publication holds the program's rows\"\ntest/yin/repl/dht_test.cljc:2437:  \"Run `w` until every shell's latest index publication is reported.\"\ntest/dao/space/transactor_test.cljc:9:   retained history. publish! builds and enqueues the covered indexes into\ntest/dao/space/transactor_test.cljc:153:   publication enqueued.\"\ntest/dao/space/transactor_test.cljc:723:;; publish!\ntest/dao/space/transactor_test.cljc:734:    (testing \"publish! returns the manifest and its content address\"\ntest/dao/space/transactor_test.cljc:735:      (let [{:keys [manifest-address manifest]} (transactor/publish! log)]\ntest/dao/space/transactor_test.cljc:742:    (testing \"publication touches no stream lifecycle\"\ntest/dao/space/transactor_test.cljc:749:      (let [{:keys [manifest]} (transactor/publish! log\ntest/dao/space/transactor_test.cljc:754:      (let [{:keys [manifest]} (transactor/publish! log {:branching-factor 16})]\ntest/dao/space/transactor_test.cljc:756:    (testing \"publish! does not consume the local stream\"\ntest/dao/space/transactor_test.cljc:766:    (let [{:keys [manifest-address manifest]} (transactor/publish! log)\ntest/dao/space/transactor_test.cljc:776:            {:keys [manifest-address manifest]} (transactor/publish! log2)\ntest/yin/repl/store_test.cljc:394:(deftest a-file-store-opens-content-jing-and-receives-publications\ntest/yin/repl/store_test.cljc:405:        (testing \"the publication is on disk, at <dir>/content.jing\"\ntest/yin/repl/store_test.cljc:844:             publication; elsewhere the rename alone publishes\"))\ntest/yin/repl/store_test.cljc:976:(deftest a-publication-interrupted-before-the-rename-reopens-the-previous-snapshot\ntest/yin/repl/store_test.cljc:1262:        (testing \"the first post-restart publication's HEAD covers old and\ntest/yin/repl/store_test.cljc:1345:    (let [{:keys [manifest-address]} (transactor/publish! tx)]\ntest/yin/repl/store_test.cljc:1398:        (testing \"before a new publication\"\ntest/yin/repl/store_test.cljc:1404:        (testing \"after a new publication\"\ntest/yin/repl/query_test.cljc:380:  (testing \"a failed publication\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
